qwen2.5-7b\_few-shot-3  & $7.2\!\times\!10^{-15}$ & $-0.00\%$ & $6.8\!\times\!10^{-4}$ & $-0.01\%$ \\
qwen2.5-7b\_few-shot-5  & $8.2\!\times\!10^{-15}$ & $+0.00\%$ & $5.6\!\times\!10^{-4}$ & $+0.05\%$ \\
